.TH DANNAN-IMPORT-MACHA 1 2026-11-13 Dannan "Dannan tools"
.SH NAME
dannan-import-macha \- move a Macha node's state into Dannan's formats
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B dannan-import-macha
.RB [ \-\-dry-run ]
.I STATE
.SH DESCRIPTION
.B dannan-import-macha
converts the roster, the inbound answer and the last-known telemetry in the
Macha state directory
.I STATE
into Dannan's formats, once, with the node stopped. Each original is kept as
.IR name .macha;
restoring those is the rollback. It prints each file and what was done with it.
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
.B \-\-dry-run
Says what would be done and changes nothing.
.SH EXIT STATUS
0 on success, 1 when the import is refused or fails, 2 for a usage error.
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR dannan-ca (1),
.BR dannan-version (1)
